    "body": "Closes #443\n\n## Summary\n- add a side-effect-free vault preview builder for deposit, withdraw, create-lock, and balance review flows\n- expose operation, amount, native asset, public wallet, network, base-fee estimate, support state, and safe warnings\n- accept public wallet addresses only; previews never accept signing secrets or submit/simulate vault operations\n- reject unknown runtime operation values with the SDK's typed `PocketPayError` validation contract before readiness lookup\n- mark lock previews as non-executable with an explicit warning rather than implying unsupported behavior\n- document safe-sharing semantics and public API usage\n\n## Validation\n- current head: `72dd98a5d35618b08bf46ecd72c3c82c29d660cd`\n- fork/base compare: 7 commits ahead, 0 behind; exactly 5 intended files, +289/-0\n- focused acceptance file now covers deposit, read-only balance, unsupported lock preview, malformed wallet, missing write amount, and an unknown runtime operation\n- unknown runtime operation is represented as `PocketPayError` code `INVALID_OPERATION` with validation metadata `field=operation`, `reason=unsupported_value`\n- no hosted workflow runs are registered on this exact head\n- local full npm verification is not claimed because this cloud shell cannot resolve github.com to materialize dependencies\n\n## Scope\nNo signing, submission, Soroban RPC execution, vault mutation, or unrelated payment/transaction behavior is changed.",
